    "detailed_description": "You are visiting your friend neverfragged98. Your friend is a Twitch streamer. He streams late into the night and you fall asleep. When you wake up, it is 3 a.m. and your friend is gone. The stream is still running and a user with the name streamofflinesoon86 has written: &quot;I have informed the FBI that there is a dangerous assassin in your apartment. They will be here in 60 minutes and will open fire immediately.&quot;<br><br>Escape from this room as quickly as you can!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can expect:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 original puzzles<br></li><li>Approx. 20 minutes of playing time<br></li><li>An escape room with lots of details in a low-poly look<br></li><li>A very <i>special</i> ending<br></li><li>Steam achievements!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thank you!</h2>By purchasing this game you also support GUM Games, a solo indie game developer from Northern Germany, which regularly publishes free trash games such as Colon Racer, the Anzeigenhauptmeister Simulator, My Chicken Nuggets burn!!! - The Game and many more!",
